  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 203.28 Burden of Proof. Unless otherwise specified by law, the burden of proof shall be on the moving party.\n\nSource. #7349, eff 8-22-00; ss by #8230-A, eff 12-17-04 (formerly Saf-C 203.27)",
